  "notes": "B.S. Computer Science, College of Aerospace, Computing, Engineering and Design. SEMESTER SYSTEM — all credits are semester hours. Built from the official MSU Denver Computer Science 4-Year Degree Plan, Fall 2025 Catalog Year (http://msudenver.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/CS-4-Year-Degree-Plan-Fall-2025-2.pdf). Major: CS 1030/1050/1400/2050/2240/2400/3210/3240/3250/3600/3700/4050/4360, MTH 1110/1120/1410/3120/3130, PHI 3370, plus 3 CS Upper Division Electives (4cr each) and 6cr Natural & Physical Sciences. General Studies 33cr: Written Communication (ENG 1010/1020), Oral Communication (COMM 1010/1100), Quantitative Literacy (MTH 1410), Arts & Humanities, Historical, Natural & Physical Sciences (6cr), Social & Behavioral Sciences (6cr, one with Global Diversity), plus ESSJ and Senior Experience (CS 4360). All prerequisite/major/ancillary courses require C or better. 120 semester credits total.",
